-- A determination of stockholders of record entitled to notice or to vote applies to any adjournment of the meeting; the
-- board may fix a new record date for determining who may vote at the adjourned meeting, and then shall also fix, as the
-- record date for notice of the adjourned meeting, the same or an earlier date than the one fixed for voting.
-- src:789 | A determination of stockholders of record entitled to notice of or to vote at a meeting of stockholders shall apply to any adjournment of the meeting; provided, however, that the board of directors may fix a new record date for determination of stockholders entitled to vote at the adjourned meeting, and in such case shall also fix as the record date for stockholders entitled to notice of such adjourned meeting the same or an earlier date as that fixed for determination of stockholders entitled to vote in accordance with the foregoing provisions of this subsection (a) at the adjourned meeting.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 213(a) (src:789)
GIVEN `the board fixes a new record date for determining the stockholders entitled to vote at the adjourned meeting` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 213(a) the earlier determination of stockholders of record applies to the adjourned meeting` `the board fixes a new record date for determining the stockholders entitled to vote at the adjourned meeting` MEANS
    NOT `the board fixes a new record date for determining the stockholders entitled to vote at the adjourned meeting`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 213(a) (src:789)
GIVEN `the record date fixed for notice of the adjourned meeting` IS A DATE
      `the record date fixed for determining the stockholders entitled to vote at the adjourned meeting` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 213(a) the record date for notice of the adjourned meeting is the same as or earlier than the record date for voting` `the record date fixed for notice of the adjourned meeting` `the record date fixed for determining the stockholders entitled to vote at the adjourned meeting` MEANS
    `the record date fixed for notice of the adjourned meeting` AT MOST `the record date fixed for determining the stockholders entitled to vote at the adjourned meeting`

-- Who is entitled: the stockholders of record at the close of business on the record date (the record date is the date for
-- "determining the stockholders entitled"). A person became a stockholder of record on one day and may have ceased on a later
-- one; at the close of business on the record date the person is of record if the person had become so by then and had not
-- ceased by then.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 213(a) (src:789)
GIVEN `the day the person became a stockholder of record` IS A DATE
      `the day the person ceased to be a stockholder of record, if the person has` IS A MAYBE DATE
      `the record date` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 213 the person was a stockholder of record at the close of business on the record date` `the day the person became a stockholder of record` `the day the person ceased to be a stockholder of record, if the person has` `the record date` MEANS
        `the day the person became a stockholder of record` AT MOST `the record date`
    AND CONSIDER `the day the person ceased to be a stockholder of record, if the person has`
        WHEN NOTHING THEN TRUE
        WHEN JUST ceased THEN ceased GREATER THAN `the record date`

§§ `s 213(b) The record date for action by written consent`

-- The board may fix a record date that shall not precede the date the resolution fixing it is adopted and shall not be more
-- than 10 days after that date.
-- src:790 | In order that the corporation may determine the stockholders entitled to consent to corporate action without a meeting in accordance with § 228 of this title, the board of directors may fix a record date, which record date shall not precede the date upon which the resolution fixing the record date is adopted by the board of directors, and which date shall not be more than 10 days after the date upon which the resolution fixing the record date is adopted by the board of directors. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 213(b) (src:790)
GIVEN `the day proposed as the record date` IS A DATE
      `the day the board adopts the resolution fixing the record date` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 213(b) the board of directors may fix the day as the record date for consent without a meeting` `the day proposed as the record date` `the day the board adopts the resolution fixing the record date` MEANS
        `the day proposed as the record date` AT LEAST `the day the board adopts the resolution fixing the record date`
    AND `the day proposed as the record date` AT MOST (`the date` (`period in days` 10) `after` `the day the board adopts the resolution fixing the record date`)

-- If the board fixes none: when no prior board action is required by this chapter, the record date is the first date a signed
-- consent setting forth the action is delivered to the corporation in accordance with s 228(d); when prior board action is
-- required, the close of business on the day the board adopts the resolution taking that prior action.
-- src:790 | If no record date has been fixed by the board of directors, the record date for determining stockholders entitled to consent to corporate action without a meeting, when no prior action by the board of directors is required by this chapter, shall be the first date on which a signed consent setting forth the action taken or proposed to be taken is delivered to the corporation in accordance with § 228(d) of this title. If no record date has been fixed by the board of directors and prior action by the board of directors is required by this chapter, the record date for determining stockholders entitled to consent to corporate action in writing without a meeting shall be at the close of business on the day on which the board of directors adopts the resolution taking such prior action.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 213(b) (src:790)
GIVEN `the record date the board fixed` IS A MAYBE DATE
      `prior action by the board of directors is required by this chapter` IS A BOOLEAN -- out of range: the section of this chapter that requires prior action by the board (pieces dg1 to dg11)
      `the first day a signed consent setting forth the action was delivered to the corporation in accordance with s 228(d)` IS A MAYBE DATE -- out of range: s 228(d) (piece dg5)
      `the day the board adopts the resolution taking the prior action` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`s 213(b) the record date for consent without a meeting` `the record date the board fixed` `prior action by the board of directors is required by this chapter` `the first day a signed consent setting forth the action was delivered to the corporation in accordance with s 228(d)` `the day the board adopts the resolution taking the prior action` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the record date the board fixed`
    WHEN JUST fixed THEN JUST fixed
    WHEN NOTHING THEN
        IF `prior action by the board of directors is required by this chapter`
        THEN `the day the board adopts the resolution taking the prior action`
        ELSE `the first day a signed consent setting forth the action was delivered to the corporation in accordance with s 228(d)`

§§ `s 213(c) The record date for any other purpose`

-- Dividends, distributions, rights, changes, conversions or exchanges of stock, or any other lawful action: the board may fix a
-- record date that shall not precede the date the resolution is adopted and shall be not more than 60 days prior to the action.
-- The text sets no latest day relative to the action (fork F-U).
-- src:791 | In order that the corporation may determine the stockholders entitled to receive payment of any dividend or other distribution or allotment of any rights or the stockholders entitled to exercise any rights in respect of any change, conversion or exchange of stock, or for the purpose of any other lawful action, the board of directors may fix a record date, which record date shall not precede the date upon which the resolution fixing the record date is adopted, and which record date shall be not more than 60 days prior to such action. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 213(c) (src:791)
GIVEN `the day proposed as the record date` IS A DATE
      `the day the board adopts the resolution fixing the record date` IS A DATE
      `the day of the action` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
