        `the day proposed as the record date` AT LEAST `the day the board adopts the resolution fixing the record date`
    AND `the day proposed as the record date` AT LEAST (`the date` (`period in days` 60) `before` `the day of the action`)

-- If no record date is fixed, the record date is the close of business on the day the board adopts the resolution relating to the action.
